<h1>Turbo Streams over Sossego</h1>
<p>
  "+1" updates the counter on the server, which publishes a <code>&lt;turbo-stream&gt;</code> on the board's stream.
  The response to the click is empty: this tab updates the same way the others do.
</p>

<div data-controller="sossego"
     data-sossego-url-value="<%= board_stream_path %>"
     data-sossego-last-event-id-value="<%= @head %>">
  <div class="board">
    <% @counters.each do |counter| %>
      <%= render "board/counter", counter: counter %>
    <% end %>
  </div>
</div>
